Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer’s bookkeeping brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Talia Nuru\nSeller: Kendi Mavo\nService: Monthly bookkeeping for Talia’s small trading business in Kenya.\n\nPlease reconcile the business income and expense entries for the March accounting period against the statements I supply. Categorize the entries and prepare a monthly profit and loss report. I will provide the statements and a list of any cash expenses separately.\n\nThe agreed fee is INR 8,500 for the monthly work. Please flag entries you cannot identify rather than guessing their category. The report should be sent electronically, with a short list of any unresolved items. We have not agreed on a delivery date."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer–seller chat",
      "text": "Talia, 09:10: I have sent the statements and cash expense list for the March bookkeeping.\nKendi, 09:18: Thanks. I’ll reconcile the entries and prepare the monthly profit and loss report.\nTalia, 09:21: Please list any transactions you cannot categorize confidently.\nKendi, 09:25: I will include an unresolved-items list with the report.\nTalia, 09:30: Can you confirm the fee before I pay?\nKendi, 09:33: It is INR 8,500 for the monthly work, as agreed in your brief.\nTalia, 09:36: Fine. We can arrange the delivery timing later."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller’s invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nSeller: Kendi Mavo\nBuyer: Talia Nuru\nService period: March bookkeeping\n\nMonthly bookkeeping: reconcile supplied income and expense entries and categorize transactions — INR 8,500\nMonthly profit and loss report and unresolved-items list — included\n\nTotal due: INR 8,500\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe fee covers the work described above for one monthly accounting period. Entries that cannot be categorized from the information supplied will be identified on the unresolved-items list. This invoice does not set a delivery date. The buyer and seller will arrange delivery timing separately."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: INR 8,500",
      "value": "INR 8,500"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: monthly profit and loss report",
      "value": "monthly profit and loss report"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: agreed delivery date",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Talia Nuru",
      "value": "Talia Nuru"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Kendi Mavo",
      "value": "Kendi Mavo"
    }
  ]
}
